WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.547
Hi! Let me tell you about my family's jobs.

2
00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:10.084
My sister is a nurse. She has to wear a uniform.

3
00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:16.421
She has to wake up at five thirty every day!

4
00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:22.711
My brother is a pilot. He has to travel a lot.

5
00:00:24.961 --> 00:00:27.237
And me? I work at home.

6
00:00:27.687 --> 00:00:32.006
I don't have to wear a uniform, and I don't have to take the bus!

7
00:00:34.256 --> 00:00:37.042
And you? What do you have to do at work?

